window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Return to the Hissing Booth Chronicles and brace yourself for a harrowing adventure, where senile witches, tweenaged werewolves, and dieting vampires set the stage for a Thanksgiving holiday like no other.</b><br> <br> As the morning unfolds with magic muffins and undead turkeys, seasoned soothsayer Journi McCutcheon is unfazed. She makes a living off weird, after all. But when a body is discovered with a litter of comatose kittens, her visions reveal the fate of the world rests in their tiny paws.<br> <br> Journi embarks on a perilous quest, enlisting the aid of a shapeshifting veterinarian and a chain-smoking cat rescuer. Together, they must solve the mysterious murder and prevent an apocalyptic virus of epic purrportions. Failure means Aunt Bernadette’s infamous mystery-meat casserole will be the least of Journi’s worries.<br> <br> In this fur-flying third installment, urban fantasy meets the hazardous world of cat rescue. Join Journi as she unravels secrets, battles supernatural foes, and fights to protect the felines who hold the key to salvation. Listen now.</p>"; 
